  "description": {
    "en": "The Tecnifibre FIRE 260 OS is the lightest and most forgiving model in the FIRE range. Featuring a 110 sq.in oversize head, 260 g unstrung weight, 330 mm balance and a 16x19 string pattern, it delivers effortless power, exceptional comfort and a very large sweet spot. X-DAMP technology reduces harmful vibration by approximately 36%, helping protect the arm while maintaining excellent comfort. The revised frame geometry and centralized weight distribution improve racket-head acceleration, making it an ideal choice for beginners, club players, doubles specialists and developing juniors.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre FIRE 260 OS 是 FIRE 系列中最轻量、容错率最高的一款球拍，采用110平方英寸超大拍面、260克空拍重量、330毫米平衡点及16×19开放式线床。超大甜区能够有效提升击球容错率，并轻松提供更多力量，非常适合俱乐部球员、双打球员及青少年进阶使用。X-DAMP 技术可减少约36%的有害震动，进一步保护手臂并提升舒适性。相比上一代，拍框截面更加方正且整体薄约5%，重量更加集中，使拍头加速更加轻松，是一支极易上手且拥有优秀舒适性的现代化 Oversize 球拍。"
  },

